Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I swear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:29.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,these Republican spies are such pushovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.13,0:00:44.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But this guy will be different...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Ten days go by fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Teach, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:55.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:57.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Nor I you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:01:00.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You were off vacationing in the Lylat Kingdom, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.21,0:01:01.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You lucky dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:03.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I hear their seafood is to die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I had a pretty good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:06.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,How was your break?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:12.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And I bought souvenirs,\Nso you should come over to the dining room!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:16.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I timed the food to be ready\Nright when you got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:19.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:22.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That does smell nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:25.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,By the way, where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:28.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They haven't gotten back from their vacations yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Slackers, the lot of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Of course, that was all a load of lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:57.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I figured that even the mighty\NKlaus would let his guard down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:58.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,after having just come back from a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:01.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than that to make\Na first-rate spy slip up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You've improved a lot,\Nbut you still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:07.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna browbeat us,\Nat least teach us how to do it right next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Conduct your surprise attacks floatily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That concludes the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:12.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You haven't improved one bit, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Still, your enthusiasm came across loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:16.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:19.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We're all fired up and ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:23.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,After all, Lamplight's been promoted from a\Nprovisional team to an actual team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:26.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to do my best on our first official mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I've got all my ducks in a row, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:31.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to put our unity to the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:34.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Your passion is all well and good
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but our first official mission is already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:38.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I finished three missions in the Lylat Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,as well as another two domestically.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:44.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The next mission's going to be our sixth one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:49.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You completed these on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,In that tiny time frame?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.67,0:04:27.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I find that hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:29.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but I guess I should know better than to doubt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:35.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That said, we went out of our way to get\Nthe girls formally registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:38.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you bring them with you to Lylat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:40.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They need more training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They're talented, I'll give them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But they aren't ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:47.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The only reason I brought them along\Nlast time was because
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.75,0:04:49.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,it was the only way I could fool Guido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:52.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you'll end up leaving them\Nrotting on the bench for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You act like that's a foregone conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's a mistake you seem all too liable to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:59.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'd like to take a sabbatical from missions for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:02.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Surely that last set I completed must have\Nbought us some breathing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I want to gather up whatever intel I can on Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:08.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You know full well that that isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:11.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Even as we speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:15.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,the Empire is defiling our borders by\Nsending villainous spies across them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:20.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Stopping them is costing our countrymen their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:24.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Losing Inferno cost our nation dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:30.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,In particular, this mission is one\Nthat only you can complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You're refusing to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I memorized the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What choice do I have but to accept it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:45.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can protect the masses\Nthat Inferno so loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:57.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I brought you some tea, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:01.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,As I've told you a million times,\Nplease stop calling me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Those are some excellent leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They must have been expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:08.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Their fragrance caught my attention\Nwhile I was out on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:11.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to serve you anything but the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:13.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:17.21,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,What did I do to inspire such affection from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:29.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,How beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This was a bold attempt at seduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I commend your bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:40.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is that not what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:51.08,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Looking back, it still doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:52.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything to deserve such fondness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:57.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You didn't make it back until quite late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll be able to take it easier tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:00.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I just took on a big mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and I got ordered to rewrite my mission reports, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:09.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,When I wrote, "Somehow or other, I got it done,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:10.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I got told to quit screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:16.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If it's all right with you,\NI'd like to hold you to my bosom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:23.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Why would that be all right with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be so bashful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:28.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Please, don't hesitate to let me dote on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:31.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Just for the record,\Nis this you practicing your seduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:32.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:35.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Boss, I promise I'm not trying to deceive you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:37.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All I want is for you to take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:42.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We succeeded in the last Impossible Mission\Nlargely on the back of your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And even now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:50.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,you're completing missions, doing admin work,\Nand teaching us all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.63,0:07:52.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the concern,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:54.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but you should just be focusing on your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:07:56.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,For now, that means attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:59.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You mean, you want me to make a move on you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:01.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Grete,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:04.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,the next time you come to my room,\Nyou had better bring one of the others along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,B-but that's bigamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:12.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thea must have been putting\Nideas in her head again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I feel oddly tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:18.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I guess the fatigue's catching up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:25.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Make sure you protect 'em this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to spend worrying about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:31.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I need to prioritize the girls' safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:34.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,An assassin hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:36.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,that's your next mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:40.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Politicians from anti-Imperial parties\Nacross the world have been dying left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:43.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They leave notes intimating they've committed suicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but odds of the notes being forgeries are high.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,An assassin named Corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:49.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,who resembles a cadaver...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:51.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You're saying this is their handiwork?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's right, two weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:56.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,a politician jumped to their death right here in Din.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, that too was Corpse's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:01.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Our agent who got ahold of that intel was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:03.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Everyone we sent to take over for them was killed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:06.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,In short, it's been classified as an Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:11.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It sounds like this is going to be even harder\Nthan the last Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:15.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,As you're aware, the Empire knows your personal intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:19.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If you make any overt moves,\NCorpse will likely go to ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Take the girls along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:24.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to do this one alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:27.88,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,But if I do that, Corpse could easily kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.50,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I need to handle this one on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:35.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Before you get into it, though,\NI have another mission I need you to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That scheming codger...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That didn't even make for decent sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I take it this was you, Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:09:59.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Y-you spotted it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But I set the trap so you'd run into it\Nafter you let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:05.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It was too obvious a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Skilled spies are sensitive to hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:11.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Even someone a fair bit weaker than me\Nwould have sensed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:15.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Dang, and I thought I'd come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:18.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Have you at least stopped forgetting\Nto carry your antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:21.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that I remember it\Nnine times out of ten these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:23.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's still not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:26.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Actually, while I have you, could you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Huh? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:30.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're just going to leave us here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Ooh, is this one of those joyride dates
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you all want to participate in missions?\N{\rSubtitle-2}I've heard so much about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you all want to participate in missions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:41.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm just asking for reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Of course we want in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,With the big caveat that we really\Ndon't want to die, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We've all be putting a lot into our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:54.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I want to become a spy feared the world over\Nand have loads of people fawn over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:55.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:58.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And plus, we make less money if we're not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:11:00.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You don't have anything to worry about on that front.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:02.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Even when I complete the missions solo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I've been splitting the completion bonuses\Nevenly with the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.13,0:11:08.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm totally down to keep playing hooky-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What happened to wanting to be fawned over?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:16.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I can make loads of money, get treated\Nlike an expert spy, and be revered
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:18.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,all for doing nothing and sleeping in,\Nthat's basically the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:20.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You're letting your greed show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:26.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But if that's not an option,\Nthen I really do want to take on missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We're still spies, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:31.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All of us want to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:35.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We'll continue this conversation\Nafter the mission's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:41.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Wait, I get to join in on an operation already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:42.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I need you to spend an hour walking around town,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:46.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,then buy some drinks and come back to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Then, we go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:54.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I can deal with the target on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:56.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's not a mission, that's just a shopping trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:05.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Ah, I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:06.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Do you have any collaborators in the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:19.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:23.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,How did you know I was coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:26.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:41.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to head back\Nand write up my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:51.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,A blown tire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:54.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure what I heard was a gunshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:13.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:19.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Go west! It was a man in a beige coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:20.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:24.04,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Did he have allies after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:25.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:36.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:39.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, something is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:44.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What happened to the bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:45.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:46.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He gave me the slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Wait, he really lost you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:50.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What, feeling disillusioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:51.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:54.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's just, you sounded so confident\Nwhen you went after him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:55.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,so I'm a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:57.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:13:59.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Well, we can worry about the attack later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,For now, we need to get that arm treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:03.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:05.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Here ya go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:10.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm just following your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,"Put on that bandage,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:15.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and once I get back, stab me with your poison\Nneedle to numb my pain," you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:17.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:20.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I mean, your arm was bleeding all over place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:21.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,My arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:22.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:25.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There were two of each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:31.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,In other words, the wounded Lily I saw at first
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:34.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and the Lily who stabbed me when I came back\Nwere two different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:38.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And the me who ordered you to stab me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:41.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and the me you actually stabbed with your needle\Nwere different people as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:42.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's a trick based around disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And there's only one person that could\Npull a stunt like that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:49.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:54.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:57.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You're sensitive to traps, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You always pick up on our malice and hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:05.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's why I tricked Lily and got her\Nto stab you out of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:10.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Daughter Dearest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:12.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Now, let's fill this time with laughter and tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:14.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I just nicked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:17.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If you're lookin' for Lily's antidote,\NI've got it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:18.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Huh? But when?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I never thought it'd go so smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:25.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It stings to admit,\Nbut Grete's plans really are top-notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:27.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I was blown away, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:29.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Uh, and why wasn't I told any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:31.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If we let you know ahead of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:33.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,that information would have\Nmade its way to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:36.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I can't really argue with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:38.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We finally cornered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:41.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There's something quite enchanting about\Nseeing you down on your hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:45.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I never knew you had such a sadistic side to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:46.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:48.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You've been pushing yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:51.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If you were in peak form,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:54.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,you would have seen through my disguise\Nthe moment you saw Lily injured like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:59.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You've accomplished a lot since losing Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:04.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Even just now, you worked through your vacation\Nto make up for our inexperience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:06.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:09.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,When was the last time you took a proper day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:11.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Four hundred and sixty-five days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:14.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You're being rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:17.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,A schedule like that would have had anyone else\Ncoughing up blood and keeling over by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:20.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We want you to rely on us more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We want you to be able to rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:25.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You don't have to bear it all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You have us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:32.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Now, about that surrender declaration...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:36.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:38.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:39.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You're right, I am exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:43.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm tired to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:44.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Exactly, and that's why-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:45.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But the question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,how much longer should I keep\Nplaying along with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.63,0:16:54.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:58.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That poison needle devoid of malice\Nwas a thing of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:17:00.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I applaud the ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:03.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Isn't he supposed to be poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:07.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I wasn't able to get a clean hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:10.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I scratched him, so I was able to\Npoison him a little bit, but that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:12.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There's no way you should have been able\Nto predict the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:15.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Sure there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:18.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Your goodwill attack was effective,\Ndon't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:22.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But with how suspicious the leadup was,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:23.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I was already on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:27.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,How did you see it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:29.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The way you cleared the area was too blatant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:34.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You distracted the cops and civilians from the gunshot\Nby covering it up with a popped tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It was too well-executed to just be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I could tell it was a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:42.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,designed to catch someone who could recognize\Nthe difference between the two sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Once I realized I was clearly being baited,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,it made me be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The spy I caught today had a similar realization.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:55.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,When he discovered that both his neighbors had gone\Non vacation at the same time, he got suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:18:00.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Our Foreign Intelligence Office did\Na sloppy job clearing the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You all have magnificent talents,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:05.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and someday, they'll come into bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:08.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,At present, though, you don't have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:13.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I'd delegated today's mission to you,\Nyou would have gotten killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to rely on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I thought I was doing a better job\Ngauging my own stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:29.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:32.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I don't have my Inferno teammates anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:35.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I have to keep this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,no matter how much it eats away at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:45.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Grete...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:49.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of making you some\Nherbal tea to help you sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but I fear I ended up waking you up instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:57.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking part in\Nour training exercise this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:59.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We just finished up our postmortem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:03.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Now, once you exchange an embrace with me,\Nthe day will be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask you this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:10.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Are you in love with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,N-nothing gets past you, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:16.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:19.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You were trying to hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Grete, as far as your feelings go, I-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:23.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:27.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,don't give me your answer yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:30.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,My heart isn't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'd really like to make my position clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:34.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:41.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Another time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:44.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:49.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Could I at least give you this report for\Nthe mission you completed today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:51.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You ghostwrote it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:52.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:56.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I figured that if I observed you,\NI could at least write down the parts I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:20:00.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Ah, so I had a guardian angel that whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:02.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Does this make you want to let me dote on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:05.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ignore that question,\Nbut I really do appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:06.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.21,0:20:13.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:17.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell a soul about my mission today,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and when I chose to take Lily along,\Nit was a spur-of-the-moment whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:25.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Yet in spite of that, you observed\Nthe whole thing from start to finish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,while still finding time to lead the others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and set the stage for them to launch an attack on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The timeline was too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:34.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,When did you have time to come up with that plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:36.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's a fair question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:39.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's true that I didn't know about your mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:43.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,so once I noticed that the homing device\NI planted on Lily started moving,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:46.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,the amount of time I spent after\Npredicting your destination,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:49.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,catching a train, and figuring out the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:51.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,was two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:54.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's how long the plan took me to put together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:58.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's really nothing all that praiseworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.25,0:21:00.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All I did was take one
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:03.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,of the hundreds and thousands of mental simulations\NI ran in advance and put it to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You really went that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:06.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:11.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The man I care about is running himself ragged\Nand refusing to accept my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:14.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I can't help but feel frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:18.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,My powerlessness is making me\Na burden for my beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:25.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Grete, I've never once thought of you as a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:29.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm going on an assassin hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:30.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's the next mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:36.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Will you lend me your strength, Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:38.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:42.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Could that be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:43.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,...a proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:45.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:47.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:49.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.54,0:21:53.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I would do anything to assist you\Nand the team you built.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:55.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:21:58.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:02.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,For this mission, I need to select some members.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:03.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:05.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take the assassin on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.79,0:22:09.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,with Lamplight's four strongest members by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:13.08,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,165.6)}{\an7}SPY CLASSROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:26.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,612)}{\an7}MISSION: Daughter Dearest I
